    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '---World PVP---

    each faction has 2 races that are allied

    you
    can attack any race that is not allied

    in the open world


    ---Arena
    PvP---

    you can access the pvp arena

    from the portal in any major city

    there
    is a arena portal for every 5 levels that all give the same reward so low level
    alts are useful

    arena''s are guild based and limited to 5 guild members
    per arena.

    arena''s are also time based, check your spawn timer on your
    minimap icon to check if your arena is active'
